# P17 DDD pacemaker event-priority / timer-expiry block (one 1 ms tick).
# Inputs: p=phase(AVI) a=atrial sense v=ventricular sense r=t_v>=VRP
#         m=t_av>=AVI u=t_v>=URI e=t_v>=AEI b=atrial blanked (t_v<PVARP)
# Outputs (priority VS > VP > AS > AP): VS VP AS AP.
# Generated from src/event_priority.py (verified == pacemaker.py). Rows not listed = 0.
.i 8
.o 4
.ilb p a v r m u e b
.ob VS VP AS AP
